---
import FeatureCard from "./ui/FeatureCard.astro";
import SectionHeader from "./ui/SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section id="features" class="px-6 py-20">
  <SectionHeader title="Everything you need" description="Professional DJ mixing with no paywall surprises." />
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-content gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <FeatureCard icon="A" iconTone="deck-a" title="Dual decks">
      Overview and scrolling waveforms, beat grid, play/pause, seek, and tempo on each deck.
    </FeatureCard>
    <FeatureCard icon="B" iconTone="deck-b" title="Mixer &amp; metering">
      Gain, 3-band EQ, filter, volume, crossfader, cue/PFL, and VU meters across the mix bus.
    </FeatureCard>
    <FeatureCard icon="◎" title="Performance tools">
      Hot cues, loops, performance pads, sampler, and beat sync for live sets.
    </FeatureCard>
    <FeatureCard icon="♫" title="Library &amp; analysis">
      Folder collections, track metadata, and offline analysis for BPM, key, and loudness.
    </FeatureCard>
    <FeatureCard icon="⌘" title="MIDI control">
      Map any controller you already own, with no vendor lock-in and no surprise paywalls for hardware.
    </FeatureCard>
    <FeatureCard icon="↯" title="Low-latency mixing">
      Responsive decks and a tight mixer feel, built for live performance when timing matters.
    </FeatureCard>
  </div>
</section>
